WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.636
Kip sat down on the bridge.

2
00:00:18.637 --> 00:00:22.790
"This is a horrible day," he thought.

3
00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:26.580
Suddenly—stomp, stomp, stomp!

4
00:00:26.581 --> 00:00:33.256
Kids ran across the bridge.

5
00:00:33.257 --> 00:00:38.837
Kip dived out of the way.

6
00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:46.347
The kids went down the slide.

7
00:00:46.348 --> 00:00:52.248
Kip went back to the steps.

8
00:00:52.249 --> 00:00:54.791
But more kids were coming.

9
00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:57.638
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

10
00:00:57.639 --> 00:01:06.489
Kip ran away from the steps.

11
00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:10.866
Just then some raindrops fell.

12
00:01:10.867 --> 00:01:13.602
Soon it was raining hard.

13
00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:21.536
The kids left.

14
00:01:21.537 --> 00:01:25.368
Kip stood near the slide.

15
00:01:25.369 --> 00:01:31.243
Rain fell on him.

16
00:01:31.244 --> 00:01:35.109
He sighed.

17
00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.190
"This is a horrible—whoa!"

18
00:01:38.191 --> 00:01:42.678
Kip slipped and fell down the slide.

19
00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:47.961
Water ran down the slide.

20
00:01:47.962 --> 00:01:51.646
Zoom! Kip flew fast.

21
00:01:51.647 --> 00:02:04.199
"Whee!" cried Kip.

22
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.634
Bird flew to the playground.

23
00:02:09.635 --> 00:02:12.296
Kip was in a puddle near the slide.

24
00:02:12.297 --> 00:02:17.001
"Did you find any perfect acorns?" asked Bird.

25
00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:19.451
"No," said Kip.

26
00:02:19.452 --> 00:02:25.795
"But I found a water slide!

27
00:02:25.796 --> 00:02:33.339
This is a great day!"
